

SQL> -- COSH/SINH A-compatible function verification.
SQL> -- Functions support both parsers; this regression uses Bison for stable diagnostics.
SQL> -- Direct output is diagnostic; canonical TO_CHAR and error assertions are the
SQL> -- Oracle comparison result.
SQL> alter system set use_bison_parser = true scope = memory;

Succeed.

SQL> set feedback on;

ON
SQL> set heading on;

ON
